## Example: Entity Node

```agm
agm: 1.0
package: payments.model
version: 0.3.0

node payments.entity.invoice
type: entity
summary: represents a payment invoice with line items and status tracking
priority: high
stability: high
fields:
  id: uuid
  customer_id: uuid
  line_items: list[line_item]
  subtotal: decimal
  tax: decimal
  total: decimal
  status: enum[draft, issued, paid, voided]
  issued_at: timestamp
  due_at: timestamp
depends: [payments.entity.line_item, payments.entity.customer]
```

---

## Example: Orchestration Node

```agm
agm: 1.0
package: ci.pipeline
version: 0.1.0

node ci.orch.full_release
type: orchestration
summary: full CI/CD release orchestration with parallel testing and staged deploy
priority: high
stability: high
parallel_groups:
  - group: test_phase
    nodes: [ci.workflow.unit_tests, ci.workflow.integration_tests, ci.workflow.lint]
    depends: []
  - group: build_phase
    nodes: [ci.workflow.build_artifact]
    depends: [test_phase]
  - group: deploy_phase
    nodes: [ci.workflow.deploy_staging, ci.workflow.smoke_tests]
    depends: [build_phase]
  - group: promote_phase
    nodes: [ci.workflow.promote_production]
    depends: [deploy_phase]
```

